### Control structure 

#### if-else basic program 
```
age = int(input("Enter your age: "))
if age >= 18 :
    print("You can VOTE")
else:
    print("You can not VOTE")
```

---

#### elif basic program 
```
marks = int(input("Enter your marks "))
if marks >= 85 :
    print("Grade A+")
elif marks >= 80 :
    print("Grade A")
elif marks >= 70 :
    print("Grade B")
elif marks >= 50 :
    print("Grade C")
elif marks >= 40 :
    print("Grade D")
else :
    print("FAIL")
```

